        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, BanjaraMatch is 100% free. Registration, browsing profiles, sending interests, and chatting are all completely free for every Banjara community member."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are Banjara matrimony profiles verified?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Every profile undergoes a manual verification process to ensure authenticity and safety for all Banjara matrimony seekers."
