            <h2 id="banjara-welcome-heading">Welcome to <em>Banjara Matrimony</em></h2>
            <p>BanjaraMatch is India's leading <strong>FREE matrimonial platform</strong> exclusively for the Banjara/Lambani/Gormati community. Our mission is to preserve tradition while helping Banjara singles find life partners rooted in culture and compatibility.</p>
            
            <p>Whether you're searching for <a href="/all-profiles?gender=female" title="Banjara Brides">Banjara brides</a> or <a href="/all-profiles?gender=male" title="Banjara Grooms">Banjara grooms</a>, our platform connects you with verified profiles from across India. We serve communities in <a href="/banjara-matrimony-hyderabad" title="Hyderabad Banjara Matrimony">Hyderabad</a>, <a href="/banjara-matrimony-bengaluru" title="Bengaluru Banjara Matrimony">Bengaluru</a>, <a href="/banjara-matrimony-maharashtra" title="Maharashtra Banjara Matrimony">Maharashtra</a>, and <a href="/sitemap" title="All regional matrimony pages">cities nationwide</a>.</p>
            
            <div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #f6af04; margin: 20px 0;">
              <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 16px;"><i class="fa fa-heart"></i> Matrimonial Purpose Only</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #555;">
                <strong>This is strictly a marriage-oriented platform, not a dating website.</strong> We provide safe, non-discriminatory, non-exploitative matchmaking services exclusively for adults aged 18 years and above seeking committed matrimonial relationships.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #777;">
                We do NOT facilitate or promote: casual dating, hook-ups, compensated dating, sugar dating, mail-order spouses, or any exploitative relationships.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <p>Start your journey today — <a href="/register" aria-label="Register on BanjaraMatch" class="cta-link" style="font-weight: 600; color: #f6af04;">create your free profile</a> and explore our <a href="/all-profiles" title="Browse Verified Banjara Profiles">verified member profiles</a> to find your life partner.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Supporting Paragraph -->
