          <span class="abo-shap-2"></span>
          <span class="abo-shap-4"></span>
          <span class="abo-shap-5"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="ab-faq-lhs">
            <div id="accordion">
              <!-- FAQ 1 -->
              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                  <a class="card-link" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse1">What is BanjaraMatch?</a>
                </div>
                <div id="collapse1" class="collapse show" data-parent="#accordion">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <p>BanjaraMatch is a dedicated online matrimony platform built for the Banjara community. It helps you find verified Banjara brides and grooms based on your preferences.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- FAQ 2 -->
              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                  <a class="collapsed card-link" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse2">Is registration free?</a>
                </div>
                <div id="collapse2" class="collapse" data-parent="#accordion">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Yes! BanjaraMatch is <strong>100% FREE</strong>. Registration, profile creation, browsing matches, sending messages, and viewing contact details - everything is completely free with no subscription fees.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- FAQ 3 -->
              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                  <a class="collapsed card-link" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse3">Are profiles verified?</a>
                </div>
                <div id="collapse3" class="collapse" data-parent="#accordion">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Yes, every profile goes through a verification process to ensure authenticity and trustworthiness on the platform.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- FAQ 4 -->
              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                  <a class="collapsed card-link" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse4">Can I search by caste and location?</a>
                </div>
                <div id="collapse4" class="collapse" data-parent="#accordion">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Absolutely. You can filter matches by Banjara sub-caste, location, profession, education, and more to find your ideal partner.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- FAQ 5 -->
              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                  <a class="collapsed card-link" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse5">How can I contact a match?</a>
                </div>
                <div id="collapse5" class="collapse" data-parent="#accordion">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <p>After creating your free profile, you can directly message other users, view their contact details (email/phone based on their privacy settings), and send interests - all completely FREE with no charges or subscription required.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- FAQ 6 -->
              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                  <a class="collapsed card-link" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse6">Is BanjaraMatch secure and private?</a>
                </div>
                <div id="collapse6" class="collapse" data-parent="#accordion">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Yes. We use advanced data encryption, profile privacy settings, and active moderation to protect your personal information and interactions. Read our <a href="/privacy-policy" title="Privacy Policy">privacy policy</a> and <a href="/terms-conditions" title="Terms and Conditions">terms of service</a> for details. Have questions? <a href="/contact" title="Contact Support">Contact our support team</a>.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
